- Apply this fix to all API endpoints with appropriate method restrictions
- Implement a centralized request validation middleware to enforce method restrictions across all endpoints
- Configure the web server (Apache/Nginx) with Allow/Deny directives for additional method-level access control
- Monitor and alert on unusual HTTP method usage patterns
